      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A novel cascade DCC/annulation reaction of N-alkoxybenzamides with β-keto esters has been developed for the synthesis of isoquinolinone derivatives under palladium catalysis. A plausible mechanism involving α-C(sp2)-H activation and a Pd(II)/Pd(IV) catalytic cycle is also proposed."},
